# Copy to .env (same folder as PokerNow.command). Never commit .env.
# Your PokerNow login cookie — lets fetch/live include YOUR un-shown hole cards.
# Browser DevTools → Application → Cookies → pokernow.com → npt
#POKERNOW_NPT=
# Or, if login needs more than the npt cookie, paste the whole Cookie header:
#POKERNOW_COOKIES=
# Optional: where game archives live (default: ./data next to PokerNow.command)
#POKERNOW_DATA_DIR=
# Optional: web UI port (default 8765)
#POKERNOW_PORT=8765
